{"id":"vod_sn_35677","vodId":"35677","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"Punch Line","name_cn":"Punch Line","date":"2015-01-01","year":"2015","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/725ce463229e861d08b4bc5ec3714124.jpg"},"summary":"伊里达游太（井上麻里奈 配音）只是一个平凡的高中男生，沉默寡言而又不露声色。一场意外之中他竟然灵魂出窍，就此来到了名为古来馆的公寓之中。为了找回肉身，游太必须找到隐藏在公馆之中的圣典，就这样，小小的一幢公寓成为了游太的整个世界。　　呆萌可爱的当红偶像成木野美香丹（雨宫天 配音）、整天宅在家里沉迷于游戏之中的曳尾谷爱（寿美菜子 配音）、其貌不扬却身为超级黑客的台初明香（钉宫理惠 配音）、虽然身为灵媒师却不相信幽灵存在的秩父拉布拉（户松遥 配音），居住在古来馆的，是这些个性迥异稀奇古怪的房客们。在寻找圣典的同时，游太那神秘的过去也渐渐浮出了水面。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:36:44","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/L9QAevRyLt1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/1GigmLWSAC1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/iWU9HQNXSa1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/2pyiaMUT9Z1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/rsgqdCFBTr1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/HaXjjm7a4Y1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/cE6iSk70xM1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/xUd9nhcd981/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/RPhN0Dc0411/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Hqm6p98SPQ1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/7yGRrd16MM1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Utr4W4hSrQ1/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:45:32.172Z"}